<p>First change is relatively simple, 38 changed to 44.</p>
<p>There were actually two attempts, but it's easy to see what you mean. I'll add probably just one more on that part. I'm not sure how to amend your lack of interest with the other tests though.</p>
<p>The book is supposed to feel like a waste of time, but I guess that got the point across entirely too well. Essentially, the transcript is there to show the sadistic nature of the contents without being overly fluffy and to hit an emotional vein, but guess I missed the mark for you. Fixed the quote box.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">me&nbsp;trying&nbsp;to&nbsp;change&nbsp;your&nbsp;view&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;transcript&nbsp;through&nbsp;story</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
