<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>You are a civilian. For the past half week, you have been unable to document anything. Your job, your ideas, your methods of communication have all been in the trash for four days now. The mystical blocky curse from the heavens have stopped you from doing anything. You can't call the police or a witch or do anything to help alleviate your current situation. You can't explain anything that's happening. This goes against all you know about the traditional world. You feel irrational and angry constantly. But in the corner of your mind, you remember seeing the blocks before. Perhaps in a bookstore, or on a book your friend owned? Randomly, a group of government people burst through your door and force you to read a book that will supposedly cure this mystical ailment. This book, however, is several hundreds of pages long. You are only a reader of moderate speed. A book like this will take upwards of 8 hours worth of your time, and they want you to read it in one sitting. You settle down with a bunch of armed strangers in your home, and begin to read. The book starts off strong by mocking you for being a moron. For the next 976 pages, you are mocked and screwed with on a basic mental level. You lose faith and interest in anything and everything. Against your better judgement, you want to attack someone and/or destroy the book. You don't trust the government people; you don't trust the author; hell, you don't even trust yourself at this point. You reach the end and suddenly can write again. Exhausted and confused, you turn to question one of the government people. He proceeds to grab you and spray something in your face. And you wake up. You check your phone. Your friends and your work highly concerned for you, but you can't remember having caused any alarm. When you think about it though, you can't remember the past five days. What is going on? But there aren't any answers for you.</p>
